<section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/"><paragraph>The area is <custom name="math_latex" custom:display="inline" custom:alt="pi r squared">\pi r^2</custom> and the sum <custom name="math_mathml" custom:display="inline" custom:mathml="&lt;math&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;+&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/math&gt;">a plus b</custom>.</paragraph><paragraph><custom name="math_latex" custom:display="block" custom:alt="x equals minus b plus or minus the root of b squared minus 4ac, over 2a">x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}</custom></paragraph><paragraph><custom name="math_mathml" custom:display="block" custom:mathml="&lt;math display=&quot;block&quot;&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mi&gt;e&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;&amp;#960;&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;-1&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/math&gt;">e to the i pi equals minus one</custom></paragraph><paragraph>Text with <strong>bold <custom name="math_latex" custom:display="inline" custom:alt="a over b">\frac{a}{b}</custom></strong> after.</paragraph></section>
